{"id":"4aece652594d9d3c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-exact-clock-construction.md","title":"Time-Constructible Function","display":"df-time-constructible-function — Time-Constructible Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-exact-clock-construction","aliases":["73-df-exact-clock-construction","73-df-time-constructible-function"],"display":"df-time-constructible-function — Time-Constructible Function","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-exact-clock-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-exact-clock-construction</span><span>73-df-time-constructible-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-time-constructible-function — Time-Constructible Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (candidate time bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1\\}\">\\(\\{1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span> (unary alphabet and word power, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M\\)</span> (halting-run length, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t(n)\\ge n+1)\n\\land\\exists M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=t(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t(n)\\ge n+1)\n\\land\\exists M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=t(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exact clock construction supplies the diagonalization budget used by the deterministic time-hierarchy theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\{1\\}$ and $1^n$ (unary alphabet and word power, see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M$ (halting-run length, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}time\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}(t)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;t(n)\\ge n+1)\n\\land\\exists M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\{1\\}}(M)\n\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(1^n)\\downarrow=t(n))\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1151,"backlinks":[{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TimeConstr}$ 使用 [[73-df-exact-clock-construction]] 的精确时钟构造谓词，记号由下式导入。"},{"id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TimeConstructible}$ (exact clock constructibility, see [[73-df-exact-clock-construction]])"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","8658210215541698"]}